Description: TI Open Source DL/ML Runtime Modules
 Prebuilt Open Source Runtime (OSRT) modules for TI EdgeAI platforms.
 Includes TFLite Runtime 2.12, ONNX Runtime 1.15 (TIDL), Apache TVM 0.18,
 and TIDL Runtime 0.1. Supports both Python and C++ APIs.
 .
 Python packages installed: tflite_runtime, onnxruntime_tidl, tvm, tidlruntime.
 Shared libraries: libonnxruntime.so, libtvm.so, libtvm_runtime.so.
 .
 Compatible with: j721e, j721s2, j784s4, j722s, j742s2, am62axx.

