Architecture: arm64
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, ti-tidl-osrt (= ${binary:Version})
Description: TI Open Source DL/ML Runtime - development files
 C++ headers and static libraries for building against the TI OSRT stack.
 Includes TFLite 2.12, ONNX Runtime 1.15, TVM 0.18, and TIDL Runtime
 headers and static libraries.
 .
 Static libraries: libtensorflow-lite.a, libtidlruntime.a.
